{"id": "De4fYE8yMjJ", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Sab chaand ki tareef karte rahe… maine tumhe dekha, aur chaand kaagaz ka lagne laga 🪔\n\nEk khidki. Do diye. Dono ki lau ek doosre ki taraf jhuki hui, jaise kuch kehna chahti ho.\nAasmaan mein ek bada sa chaand tha… door, thanda, jiske liye sab shayari likhte hain.\nPhir woh palta, aur pata chala bas kaagaz ka tha, ek dhaage pe latka hua. Taare bhi chamkeele kaagaz ke tukde nikle, ek ek karke bujh gaye.\n\nAur jab sab bujh gaya, do lau mil ke ek ho gayi.\nAsli roshni kabhi aasmaan mein thi hi nahi… woh hamesha mere paas baithi thi 🤍\n\n🎵 Bade Achhe Lagte Hain · Amit Kumar · R.D. Burman · Anand Bakshi (Balika Badhu, 1976)\n\nUs ek insaan ko bhejo jiske saamne chaand bhi kaagaz ka lagta hai\n\nBade Achhe Lagte Hain | Bade Achhe Lagte Hain Amit Kumar | Balika Badhu songs | R.D. Burman songs | Anand Bakshi songs | old Hindi love songs | romantic Hindi songs | 70s Bollywood romantic songs | diya animation | sketch animation | animated music video\n\n#BadeAchheLagteHain #AmitKumar #RDBurman #AnandBakshi #SketchAnimation", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792856931, "like_count": 463, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-29123878770558367a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 46.805, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMRhDGa3jQMu5OG9Ytq0h5Xy0vtZy6RRUtCL_ZNQlXkFvXy5boP2WFrLhg1vwzIcG3sOr9QR9tJJKHZUun5AB3Y6VJy4smsE-z8l5A.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdrJgPBL9tXj39k-ub6XT6RzGdc5DuMfK4J5S1J67ubES4_LhsHA6Xrn0n1jPbZAB59g4q7reHSRYpQY1_XPWRip&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=k3jLP9Ya--sQ7kNvwHrm26e&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=7_DsKZcsmqmPWCXaydM-Ow&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTsMB1gA2t1-394Q